sequenceDiagram
    participant Code
    participant AST Analyzer
    participant CWE Detector
    participant STRIDE Analyzer
    participant Report
    
    Code->>AST Analyzer: Parse Code
    AST Analyzer->>CWE Detector: Check Patterns
    CWE Detector->>CWE Detector: Scan for 6 CWEs
    CWE Detector->>STRIDE Analyzer: Security Context
    STRIDE Analyzer->>STRIDE Analyzer: Map to STRIDE
    STRIDE Analyzer->>Report: Vulnerabilities + Mitigations
    Report->>Code: Actionable Fixes
